Subject: [PATCH 24/31] arm64: dts: r8a77970: Add INTC-EX device node
Date: Fri, 20 Oct 2017 12:28:27 +0200
Message-Id: <c6a7fd98966015df742fe15d5a01827262f4fc41.1508495040.git.horms+renesas@verge.net.au>
